Package: sysmon
Version: 1.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.6), python3-tk, python3-psutil, wmctrl, x11-utils
Maintainer: System Monitor Team <sysmon@example.com>
Description: Beautiful desktop system monitor for Linux (Conky-style widget)
 Desktop System Monitor shows real-time system statistics
 directly on your desktop wallpaper with a beautiful dark theme.
 Sticks to desktop like Conky!
 .
 Features:
  - CPU, RAM, Disk, Network monitoring
  - Temperature sensors support
  - Color-coded indicators
  - Sticks to desktop wallpaper (below all windows)
  - Semi-transparent widget
  - Right-click to drag, double-click to close
  - Minimal resource usage
Homepage: https://github.com/Bakstag1337/solid-octo-fiesta
